{
  "$comment": "Synthetic activity personas for internal playtests. Each week pattern lists, per day (Mon..Sun), the categories the persona completes. The stage 2 history generator expands these into activity events with sources and times; the harness feeds them to a scratch ledger. All data is synthetic.",
